# Launcher

Swift + SwiftUI unless an ADR says otherwise. This is the only user-facing process.

- Verbs: Play, Stop. No bottle manager, Windows-version picker, or winetricks screen.
- Detection: Steam libraries + profile exe hints + a folder picker for stubborn installs.
- Talking to the runtime: a local CLI or XPC. No cloud API.
- Copy: never Wine, GPTK, CrossOver, Proton, prefix, bottle.
- Title logic: load `profiles/*.json`. If you need a new flag, add it to the schema first.

Keep UI functional. Do not build a store, account system, or animated brand shell.
